ye Haal E Zaar Kehta Tha Alam Abbas E Ghaazi Ka<br>
<br>
3-adu Kehne Lage Sare,bada Hee Naaz Tha Tum Ko<br>
ali Ka Zor Tha Jisme,wo Baazu Hai Kaha Bolo<br>
ye Haal E Zaar Kehta Tha Alam Abbas E Ghaazi Ka<br>
<br>
