na Waada Kar Saka Poora,sakina Se Hu Sharminda<br>
ye Haal E Zaar Kehta Tha Alam Abbas E Ghaazi Ka<br>
<br>
7- Bayaan Karte The Shahe Deen,sahara Ab Nahi Koi<br>
tere Marne Se Tooti Hai,zaeefi Me Kamar Meri<br>
ye Haal E Zaar Kehta Tha Alam Abbas E Ghaazi Ka<br>
<br>
